  "description": "ASP.NET Core support for Idora.NET's prefixed, time-ordered identifiers such as usr_01k2f9v8ta7m3x0qbrn4dzeh5c. An idora route constraint ({id:idora} and {id:idora(usr)}) that matches only well-formed identifiers, and [IdoraId] and [IdoraIdFor] validation attributes that check a string property is an identifier for the right entity, against an explicit prefix or the registered one.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
